+<h2><span class="n">01</span> Requirements</h2>
+<div class="grid g2">
+<div>
+<h3>Functional</h3>
+<table>
+<tr><th>ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Scenario</th></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-01</td><td>POST a valid http/https URL, get a unique 7-char Base62 code, 201 with Location</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-02</td><td>Custom alias <code>^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,32}$</code>, not reserved, not taken</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-03</td><td>Taken alias, including a lost race, answers 409</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-04</td><td>Invalid, credentialed, oversized, or internal-host URLs answer 400 with field errors</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-05</td><td>GET /{code} answers 302 + Location + Cache-Control no-store</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-06</td><td>Unknown or malformed code answers 404; malformed never hits the database</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-07</td><td>Click recorded off the request thread via a bounded queue</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-08</td><td>Stats: total, last 24h, last 7d, last clicked</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-09</td><td>Metadata read and delete with cascade</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-10</td><td>/api/v1/** requires X-API-Key; 401 carries WWW-Authenticate</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-11</td><td>Create rate limit answers 429 with Retry-After</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-12</td><td>Health, info, metrics, Prometheus; OpenAPI matching the committed copy; working Swagger UI</td><td>Greenfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-13</td><td>expiresAt: RFC 3339 with offset, future only</td><td>Brownfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-14</td><td>Expired: 410 no-store, row and history kept, expired:true in metadata and stats</td><td>Brownfield</td></tr>
+<tr><td>FR-15</td><td>"Where do clicks come from" is decided in the clarification task, not pre-decided</td><td>Ambiguous</td></tr>
+</table>
+</div>
+<div>
+<h3>Non-functional</h3>
+<table>
+<tr><th>ID</th><th>Quality</th><th>Measure</th></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-01</td><td>Portability</td><td>Green build on Windows and Linux with JDK 21 only</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-02</td><td>Performance</td><td>Redirect is one indexed read; p99 under 200 ms in-process smoke</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-03</td><td>Reliability</td><td>Analytics failure or saturation never fails a redirect</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-04</td><td>Reliability</td><td>Graceful shutdown drains queued clicks up to 10 s</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-05</td><td>Security</td><td>No open redirect beyond stored URL; non-enumerable codes; key guessing throttled; headers set</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-06</td><td>Privacy</td><td>No IP or raw user agent ever persisted</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-07</td><td>Observability</td><td>Correlation id on every request and error; counters for creates, redirects, drops</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-08</td><td>Maintainability</td><td>Methods under 50 lines, files under 400, constructor injection, enforced by Checkstyle</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-09</td><td>Testability</td><td>80 percent line, 70 percent branch, no untouched class, one runner</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-10</td><td>Change safety</td><td>Flyway-versioned schema validated at startup; SQL in the H2 and PostgreSQL intersection</td></tr>
+<tr><td>NFR-11</td><td>Process auditability</td><td>Spec, prompt, raw output, review, gates, commit, sign-off traceable; zero harness violations</td></tr>
+</table>
+<p class="legend">Assumed read:write ratio 10:1. Capacity targets are for a single laptop; the scaling path is documented, not built.</p>
+</div>
