+Module url-shortener, package dev.harshil.shortener. JUnit 6, AssertJ, Mockito, Boot 4 test starters.
+
+Intent:
+{{task.intent}}
+
+Behaviours to cover (acceptance criteria, EARS form, one test per line at minimum):
+{{task.acceptance_criteria}}
+
+Constraints:
